our repairs afterwards. The price is not on the table yet. With Moraine it never is.\n\nThe depot is a walled deck with three gates, west, north and east, a turret railway across the middle and two command centres. Kill both and the depot goes dark. There is a dock on the deck, and it will not stay full for long.\n\nThe cartel ships are on our south flank. They take our orders today. A relief column is on its way from the inner yards; Sato puts it at the depot by the seventh turn.","goal":"Destroy both Directorate command centres at the Kerberos depot within 24 turns.","guards":2,"chapter":"Act II · The Fork · Mission 6","strategy":["Swing the cartel ships around the south of the rock and come at the north gate from the meteoroids; your own force takes the west gate.","Kill the Wisp mines and the gun line in front of the west gate with ranged fire before you cross the open space.","The Dragon and Hydra cover the railway: go along the walls, not down the deck.","Bring the dock to zero before it empties its mecha onto the deck.","The relief column comes from the east on turn 7. Have both command centres down by then, or hold the east wall."],"plan":[{"n":2,"path":[[5,12],[14,13],[22,15],[28,15]]},{"n":1,"path":[[9,27],[22,25],[30,4],[34,7]]},{"n":4,"at":[32,15],"note":"Dock"},{"n":5,"at":[43,15],"note":"Relief T7"}],"comms":[{"speaker":"moraine","text":"My ships, your orders, General. Bring them home and they're yours to keep. Lose them and we'll talk about the bill."},{"speaker":"sato","text":"Her carriers are old Sirens with new paint. They still launch. That is what matters."},{"speaker":"ruess","text":"A Dragon sits on each end of that railway. Do not walk down the middle of the deck."},{"speaker":"arkin","text":"Pirates on our flank. Lovely. I will be watching them as closely as the Union."},{"speaker":"kessrin","text":"Pirates, General? I expected you to sink. I did not expect you to sink this low."}]}